OL,3,AAI chip boom pushes Samsung profits to
OL,4,Arecord $80bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamsung Electronics says it expects a
OL,7,Fnine-fold surge in its quarterly
OL,8,Fprofits compared with a year earlier,
OL,9,Fdriven by surging demand for memory
OL,10,Fchips used in artificial intelligence
OL,11,F(AI) data centres.
OL,13,FThe tech giant estimates that its
OL,14,Foperating profit for the three months
OL,15,Fto the end of September will jump to
OL,16,F107.4tn won (#61bn; $80bn), its fourth
OL,17,Fquarter in a row of record earnings.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
