OL,3,AOpenAI says teen ChatGPT use limited
OL,4,Abut research finds it an 'unacceptable
OL,5,Arisk'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOpenAI's ChatGPT for Teens was designed
OL,8,Fto promote healthier use of the
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) chatbot,
OL,10,Fbut new research has found its
OL,11,Fimportant safety features fall short.
OL,13,FThe major AI firm rolled out many teen
OL,14,Fsafety guardrails in August, including
OL,15,Fcurbs on emotional dependence and new
OL,16,Fparental alerts for problematic use.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, OpenAI said it found
OL,19,Faverage teen use of ChatGPT to be
OL,20,Frelatively limited and tended toward
OL,21,F"learning" activity.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791424452
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI says teen ChatGPT use limited
OL,4,Abut research finds it an 'unacceptable
OL,5,Arisk'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, research released the same day
OL,8,Ffrom non-profit Common Sense Media
OL,9,Ffound that ChatGPT still poses an
OL,10,F"unacceptable risk" for teens as safety
OL,11,Ffeatures, including notifying parents
OL,12,Fof self-harm conversations, often fail.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
