OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AParamount takes over Warner Bros in
OL,4,A$110bn Hollywood merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FParamount Skydance has officially taken
OL,7,Fover Warner Bros Discovery in a $110bn
OL,8,Fmerger that is set to reshape Hollywood
OL,9,Fand the media landscape.
OL,11,FThe takeover - merging two of the
OL,12,Fbiggest studios in Los Angeles - comes
OL,13,Fafter months of legal disputes and
OL,14,Fwidespread criticism over feared cuts
OL,15,Fand consolidation could harm
OL,16,Fcompetition and consumers.
OL,18,FIt will alter streaming for millions,
OL,19,Fusher in a new chapter in the film and
OL,20,FTV industry, and leave one of the
OL,21,Fbiggest US news outlets, CNN, in
OL,22,Funcertain territory.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
