OL,3,AGavin and Stacey creators Jones and
OL,4,ACorden reveal celebrity cast of new
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey co-creators Ruth Jones
OL,8,Fand James Corden have revealed details
OL,9,Fabout their new TV comedy drama series
OL,10,FThe Choir.
OL,12,FThe eight-episode show will air on
OL,13,FApple TV and feature guest appearances
OL,14,Fby Ted Lasso's Hannah Waddingham,
OL,15,FX-Men's James McAvoy and Harry Potter's
OL,16,FJim Broadbent.
OL,18,FThe series follows brother Ben (Corden)
OL,19,Fand sister Lisa (Jones), who have not
OL,20,Fseen each other for several years.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
